; World-space health bar, FFT style: the unit's timeline number, then a dark background quad with
; a team-coloured fill quad in front of it. Sizes are screen pixels; WorldHpBar scales the node so
; they keep that size at any zoom. The materials are per-instance and are built in code, because
; the fill colour is tweened.

